# ── Results & CI outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 05_Results/ holds two different kinds of thing and they have opposite rules:
#
#   1. Throwaway run output (canonical_tests/, demo runs, figures regenerated by
#      04_Code/reporting/…). Never committed — ignored by the glob below.
#   2. The EVIDENCE SURFACE: the stored artifacts that back each rung claimed in
#      docs/EVIDENCE_LADDER.md. These MUST be committed. The ladder's governance
#      rule is "every rung claimed in the docs must be backed by a committed
#      artifact under 05_Results/", 04_Code/tests/test_stored_artifacts_match_contracts.py
#      enforces it, and a third party reproducing the work (rung 9) has to be
#      able to see them in a fresh clone. They are un-ignored one by one below —
#      adding a rung means adding its artifact directory here.
#
# Note the glob is `05_Results/*`, not `05_Results/`: git does not descend into an
# ignored *directory*, so a negation inside one would never match.
05_Results/*
!05_Results/.gitkeep
!05_Results/README.md
# ── Evidence surface (rung → artifact) ──
!05_Results/endogenous_full_statistical/
!05_Results/registered_block/
!05_Results/strong_negatives/
!05_Results/oos_prediction/
!05_Results/confirmatory/
!05_Results/surrogate_null/
!05_Results/falsification/
# only the accumulation-control run is cited evidence (Test A); the
# 2026-02-18 batch is stale output from the pre-cleanup era.
05_Results/falsification/2026-02-18_batch01/
!05_Results/real_validation/
!05_Results/pilots/
!05_Results/pilot_benchmark_summary.json
!05_Results/PILOT_GENERALIZATION_REPORT.md
!05_Results/FULL_REAL_DATA_REPORT.md
_ci_out/

# ── Extracted bundles (generated, not versioned — re-extract from data/bundles/*.zip)
data/bundles_extracted/

# ── Local runs (generated, not versioned) ────────────────────────────────────
runs/

# ── Scratch / temp directories ───────────────────────────────────────────────
_demo_out/
_demo_oric_out*/
_demo_robust_out*/
_tmp_results_ci/
_tmp_results/
_tmp*/
_cache/
_scratch*/
_sector_*/
_collected_artifacts/

# ── Python caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/

# ── Test / linter caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Matplotlib config/font cache (generated, machine-specific) ───────────────
.mplconfig/
.matplotlib/

# ── Environment files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
.venv*/
.env
venv/

# ── OS artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Jupyter ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Secrets / credentials (never commit) ────────────────────────────────────
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
credentials.json
*.secret

# ── Docker local state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.docker/

# ── Keep (explicitly tracked) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# data/real_datasets_index.csv  — canonical dataset inventory
# ci_metrics/                   — append-only metrics (tracked)
# contracts/                    — frozen audit contracts (tracked)
# data/climate/                 — small reference datasets (tracked)
# data/finance/                 — small reference datasets (tracked)
# data/survey/                  — survey datasets (tracked)
# data/qcc/                     — QCC reference data (tracked)
.claude/worktrees/
